# Build output
build/
*.obj
*.exe
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.lib
*.exp

# Compiled shaders and the HLSL generated per scene. Reproduced by spike/build.bat.
*.cso
spike/build/
app/build/

# Baked assets. Reproduced by makina_bake at import time; the point of a bake is that it is
# derived, and a committed one is a derived thing that can disagree with its source.
*.csgbake.json
*.gen.hlsl

# Java class files
*.class

# Reference dumps and converted scenes.
#
# All of it is regenerated by verify-all.bat from the .gsf files in Grasp3D, and it is large
# (sdfdump alone writes tens of thousands of samples per scene). Committing it would also make the
# reference a thing that can go stale in the repo rather than being rebuilt from the source of
# truth every run -- which is the one property the whole verification chain depends on.
tools/*/out/

# Rendered images
*.bmp
*.png

# POV-Ray output
*.pov
va.txt
